# Narrow exceptions to excluded-paths, one POSIX extended regex per line.
# Comments and blank lines are ignored.
#
# A path has to match a rule in excluded-paths AND a rule here to be committed.
# Keep this file short. Every line here is a hole in a guard that exists for a
# reason.
#
# Images are blocked everywhere because screenshots of other people's work
# nearly entered this repository. Charts generated from our own files are a
# different case, so they have one directory and no more.

^images/[a-z0-9-]+\.png$
